  "principles": [
    "Every suspected incident gets an internal incident record.",
    "Preserve evidence with least necessary personal data.",
    "Do not delay containment to complete legal qualification.",
    "Do not notify authority or users automatically without the required risk/legal decision.",
    "If a personal data breach is confirmed, maintain an internal breach record even when notification is not required.",
    "The GDPR 72-hour authority-notification rule can apply after awareness when risk to rights and freedoms exists; final applicability and timing decision require appropriate legal/privacy review."
  ],
